Hello, [~accountid:61374989bba6c7006a2616ba].

Please see my responses / comments below. Please note that to some of the questions I have suggested draft responses. However, to the rest of the questions, I have only left my comments as certain details need to be checked with the privacy team and technical team. Please let me know if you have any questions and / or comments from your side. Thanks!

·       What Bolt services does the debtor use/has used? {color:#ff5630}*DRAFT ANSWER:*{color}{color:#ff5630} The debtor has registered herself as food courier on Bolt’s platform. The debtor also also registered her eater’s account through which the debtor can order food using Bolt food platform.{color}

·       Has the debtor, POLIŠTŠUK OKSANA (48007280307), or companies owned by the debtor entered into any license agreements or other types of agreements (including main agreements) with BOLT SERVICES EE OÜ and/or BOLT OPERATIONS OÜ? If so, please provide the relevant agreement to the bailiff. {color:#ff5630}*DRAFT ANSWER*{color}{color:#ff5630}: The debtor has no license agreement concluded with BOLT SERVICES EE OÜ and/or BOLT OPERATIONS OÜ.{color}

·       Do the above-mentioned debtor or the debtor’s companies have access to and/or use services offered by Bolt Services EE OÜ (14339972) and/or Bolt Operations OÜ (14532901), such as temporarily/long-term/periodically renting motor vehicles listed in the Bolt App, using the platform operated by Bolt Operations, which consists of a mobile application (Bolt App)? {color:#ff5630}*DRAFT ANSWER*{color}{color:#ff5630}: The debtor has only registered her eater’s account through which the debtor can order food using Bolt food platform.{color}

·       Has the debtor or companies associated with them downloaded the Bolt app and created a user account, which resulted in a main agreement being concluded with Bolt Operations? {color:#ff5630}*DRAFT ANSWER*{color}{color:#ff5630}: The debtor has only registered her eater’s account through which the debtor can order food using Bolt food platform following the terms and conditions available on the company’s website.{color}

·       Has the account created by the debtor or a related company, including their mobile phone number, been added to your database? {color:#ff5630}*DRAFT ANSWER*{color}{color:#ff5630}: Yes, as mentioned above, the debtor has registered two accounts: courrier account through which the debtor is able to provide food delivery services to the client and eater account thourgh which the debtor can order food.{color}

·       Which valid credit or debit card or other payment method has the debtor linked to their account, which Bolt App supports? Please provide the credit or debit card or other payment method details that the debtor or their associated company has disclosed in the Bolt App.{color:#ff5630} Please discuss with the privacy team if can disclose such information. To my understanding, yes because this information is required by legal authorities following applicable legal acts. But please double check.{color}

·       Please provide the bailiff with the information submitted by the debtor or the associated company during account creation (including phone number, email address, residential address, and a photo from a driver’s license, ID card, or another legal government-issued identification document). {color:#ff5630}Please discuss with the privacy team if can disclose such information. To my understanding, yes because this information is required by legal authorities following applicable legal acts. But please double check. When responding to the bailiff, please also indicate that the debtor does not have a driver’s account, but only courier account on Bolt platform using which the debtor may provide food delivery services to the clients.{color}

·       Provide data supported during the web-based verification process in the Bolt App regarding the driver’s license. {color:#ff5630}*DRAFT ANSWER*{color}{color:#ff5630}: Please note that the courier does not  have a driver’s account thus has not provided her driver’s license.{color}

·       Provide the bailiff with the data recorded in IoTSeames and transmitted by Bolt concerning the time period of vehicle usage by the debtor or their company. {color:#ff5630}I think we do not have any such information, given that the debtor does not have a driver’s account on Bolt pltaform. Please double check this.{color}

·       Are the debtor’s companies registered as a Fleet Management entity and, if so, is POLIŠTŠUK OKSANA (48007280307) registered as an employee and/or service provider within said Fleet? {color:#ff5630}I think we do not have any such information, given that the debtor does not have a driver’s account on Bolt pltaform. Please double check this.{color}

·       Please provide the bailiff with a statement from the last 3 months of payments that Bolt, acting as the economic agent for the driver, has been obligated to collect from passengers and forward to the driver/debtor as in-app payments. Also provide the last 3 months of in-app payment reports from the Bolt driver portal. {color:#ff5630}Please discuss with the privacy team if we can disclose such information. To my understanding, yes because this information is required by legal authorities following applicable legal acts. But please double check. When responding to the bailiff, please also indicate that the debtor does not have a driver account, but only courier account on Bolt platform using which the debtor may provide food delivery services to the clients.{color}

·       Given that Bolt generally transfers in-app payment amounts received into the debtor’s bank account during the previous week to the driver's bank account by the fourth calendar day of the following week, please indicate when the next payment to the driver will be made and in what amount. Also specify the bank and account number to which the payment will be made. {color:#ff5630}Please discuss with the privacy team if can disclose such information. To my understanding, yes, because this information is required by legal authorities following applicable legal acts. But please double check. When responding to the bailiff, please also indicate that the debtor does not have a driver’s account, but only a courier account. The amount to be paid to the debtor (if any to be paid) is not clear because it depends on the scope of activity of the debtor which is solely controlled by the debtor herself and, therefore, we can not provide the exact information on when the next payment to the debtor will be made and in what amount.{color}

